          "_name": "article18",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article18\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#e7a61b\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n              <b>List</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Everything you need to get started with Tap and Bank, in one place.</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ul><li><b>Beginner-friendly training:</b> straightforward lessons and clear instructions, so you can start without prior online business experience.</li><li><b>Step-by-step video tutorials:</b> each stage of the setup is walked through on video, which reduces confusion and keeps you moving.</li><li><b>Fast, guided setup:</b> according to the creator, activation takes about 30 seconds &mdash; no long technical configuration.</li><li><b>No website or product creation needed:</b> the system is presented as one that doesn&rsquo;t require your own site, email list, audience or digital product.</li><li><b>Simple members area:</b> lessons, tools and updates in one place, accessible from your phone, tablet or computer.</li><li><b>3 bonus trainings included:</b> a 7-day challenge, a live training session and a masterclass &mdash; at no extra cost.</li><li><b>One-time payment:</b> the launch price is $17, with no monthly fee mentioned on the official sales page.</li><li><b>100-day money-back guarantee:</b> try the program risk-free and request a refund if it isn&rsquo;t right for you.</li></ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
