          "_name": "features8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features8\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <!---->\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitleCards\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Bg\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#fafafa\">\n\n        <select title=\"Count\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n            <option value=\"11\">11</option>\n            <option value=\"12\">12</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-cards=\"bootstrap\">\n            <div class=\"title col-12\">\n                <h5 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                    <b>Our Products</b>\n                </h5>\n                <h6 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Subtitle\n                </h6>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Pros</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><b>Low One-Time Price:<br></b>The $17 launch price is a small, one-time cost compared with courses that charge monthly fees.<br><br><b>Truly Beginner-Focused:<br></b>The lessons follow a logical sequence, so you don&rsquo;t need prior experience to follow along.<br><br><b>Quick Guided Setup:<br></b>The creator says activation takes about 30 seconds, followed by video training that explains the rest.<br><br><b>Works on Any Device:<br></b>Access the members area from a phone, tablet or computer with an internet connection.<br><br><b>Bonus Training Included:<br></b>Three extra trainings add more learning material at no additional cost.<br><br><b>Strong Refund Window:<br></b>A 100-day money-back guarantee lets you test the program with very little risk.<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Cons</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><b>Results Are Not Guaranteed:<br></b>Any earnings mentioned by the vendor are examples, not typical results. What you earn depends on your effort, background and many other factors.<br><br><b>Limited Detail Before Purchase:<br></b>The payout mechanics are explained inside the members area rather than on the sales page, so you only see the full picture after joining.<br><br><b>Internet Access Required:<br></b>It&rsquo;s an online program, so you&rsquo;ll need a reliable connection to reach the members area.<br><br><b>May Not Suit Advanced Marketers:<br></b>Experienced marketers may find the beginner-focused approach too basic.<br><br><b>Offer Terms May Change:<br></b>Pricing, bonuses and promotions are controlled by the vendor.<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>2\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>3\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$49</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>4\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>5\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$49</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>6\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>7\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>8\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$49</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>9\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>10\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$49</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>11\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
