        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor"
          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Disclaimer</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Disclaimer for <b>Tap and Bank</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The information provided on this website and within Tap and Bank products, services and training materials is for educational and informational purposes only. While every effort has been made to represent the product accurately, we make no guarantees of income, results or success.<br><br>1. Earnings Disclaimer<br><br>Tap and Bank is an online training program. Your results may vary based on factors such as your effort, skills, circumstances and external conditions. We do not promise or imply that you will achieve any specific financial result by using this product, and you may earn nothing at all.<br><br>2. No Professional Advice<br><br>Content on this website and in the training materials does not constitute business, legal, financial or professional advice. Seek guidance from qualified professionals before making decisions about your business or finances.<br><br>3. Limitation of Liability<br><br>Tap and Bank, its creators and the operators of this website are not liable for any direct, indirect or incidental damages arising from the use or misuse of the product, website or training materials.<br><br>4. Affiliate Disclosure<br><br>This website contains affiliate links. If you purchase through them we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. JVZoo is the retailer of this product; its role does not constitute an endorsement of any claim made in its promotion.<br><br>5. Testimonials &amp; Examples<br><br>Any examples or figures referenced are not guarantees of results and do not represent typical outcomes.<br><br>6. Updates &amp; Changes<br><br>We may modify this Disclaimer at any time. Changes will be posted on this page.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tLGcNcCPOQ",
          "_anchor": "content5-1g",
