        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor"
          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Privacy Policy</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Privacy Policy for <b>Tap and Bank</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">At Tap and Bank, your privacy is extremely important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit our website, purchase our products, or interact with our services. By using Tap and Bank, you agree to the terms outlined below.\n<br>\n<br>1. Information We Collect\n<br>\n<br>When you use our website or purchase our products, we may collect:\n<br>\n<br>Personal Information: Name, email address, billing address, and payment details.\n<br>\n<br>Account Information: Username, password, and purchase history.\n<br>\n<br>Technical Data: IP address, browser type, operating system, and device information.\n<br>\n<br>Usage Data: Pages visited, time spent on the site, and other analytics to improve user experience.\n<br>\n<br>2. How We Use Your Information\n<br>\n<br>We use the information collected to:\n<br>\n<br>Process payments and deliver your products.\n<br>\n<br>Provide customer support and respond to inquiries.\n<br>\n<br>Improve our website, products, and services.\n<br>\n<br>Send updates, promotional offers, or important notifications (you may opt out anytime).\n<br>\n<br>Protect against fraudulent or unauthorized transactions.\n<br>\n<br>3. Sharing of Information\n<br>\n<br>We respect your privacy and do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. However, we may share your data with:\n<br>\n<br>Service Providers: Payment processors, hosting services, and email platforms needed to operate our business.\n<br>\n<br>Legal Requirements: If required by law or in response to valid legal processes.\n<br>\n<br>4. Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies\n<br>\n<br>Tap and Bank uses cookies and similar technologies to:\n<br>\n<br>Enhance site performance and functionality.\n<br>\n<br>Remember user preferences for a personalized experience.\n<br>\n<br>Track analytics to improve marketing and site content.\n<br>You may disable cookies in your browser, but some features of the site may not function properly.\n<br>\n<br>5. Data Security\n<br>\n<br>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. However, no system is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.\n<br>\n<br>6. Your Rights\n<br>\n<br>You have the right to:\n<br>\n<br>Access, update, or delete your personal data.\n<br>\n<br>Request a copy of the information we hold about you.\n<br>\n<br>Opt out of marketing communications at any time.\n<br>\n<br>To exercise these rights, please contact us at support@tapandbank.us.\n<br>\n<br>7. Third-Party Links\n<br>\n<br>Our website may contain links to third-party sites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites.\n<br>\n<br>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy\n<br>\n<br>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with the updated effective date.\n<br>\n<br>9. Contact Us\n<br>\n<br>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please contact us at:\n<br>\n<br>Tap and Bank Support Team\n<br>Email: support@tapandbank.us<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
