          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Terms and Conditions</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Terms and Conditions for <b>Tap and Bank</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Welcome to Tap and Bank. By accessing, purchasing, or using our website, products, or services, you agree to comply with the following Terms and Conditions. Please read them carefully before using our platform.\n<br>\n<br>1. Acceptance of Terms\n<br>\n<br>By using Tap and Bank, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use our website or products.\n<br>\n<br>2. Use of the Product\n<br>\n<br>Tap and Bank is provided for personal and business use.\n<br>\n<br>You may not copy, resell, or redistribute our product without prior written consent.\n<br>\n<br>You agree not to use Tap and Bank for unlawful, harmful, or fraudulent purposes.\n<br>\n<br>3. Intellectual Property\n<br>\n<br>All content, designs, products, and training materials provided with Tap and Bank are the intellectual property of the creators. Unauthorized use, reproduction, or distribution is strictly prohibited.\n<br>\n<br>4. Payments &amp; Pricing\n<br>\n<br>All purchases are processed through the secure JVZoo checkout.\n<br>\n<br>Prices for Tap and Bank and related offers are set by the vendor and are subject to change without prior notice.\n<br>\n<br>Coupons and discounts may be offered at our discretion.\n<br>\n<br>5. Refund Policy\n<br>\n<br>Tap and Bank is covered by a 100-day money-back guarantee as stated on the official sales page. If you are not satisfied, contact support within 100 days of purchase to request a refund.\n<br>\n<br>6. Third-Party Tools &amp; Services\n<br>\n<br>Purchases and payments are handled by third parties such as JVZoo. We are not responsible for the availability, performance, or policies of these third parties.\n<br>\n<br>7. User Responsibilities\n<br>\n<br>By using Tap and Bank, you agree to:\n<br>\n<br>Provide accurate and up-to-date information during registration and checkout.\n<br>\n<br>Maintain the confidentiality of your login credentials.\n<br>\n<br>Take responsibility for all activities under your account.\n<br>\n<br>8. Limitation of Liability\n<br>\n<br>We make no guarantees of specific results, income, or success from using Tap and Bank. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Tap and Bank and its creators are not liable for any damages, losses, or claims arising from the use or misuse of our product.\n<br>\n<br>9. Termination\n<br>\n<br>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to Tap and Bank without notice if you violate these Terms or misuse the product.\n<br>\n<br>10. Modifications\n<br>\n<br>We may update these Terms and Conditions at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with the updated effective date. Your continued use of Tap and Bank after updates indicates your acceptance of the revised Terms.\n<br>\n<br>11. Governing Law\n<br>\n<br>These Terms are governed by and construed under the laws of USA. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in that location.\n<br>\n<br>12. Contact Us\n<br>\n<br>If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at:\n<br>\n<br>Tap and Bank Support Team\n<br>Email: support@tapandbank.us<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tLGdvaL88b",
